WEBVTT

00:10:58.734 --> 00:11:03.235
Then one day, after the election,
I was taking my sons to school,

00:11:03.259 --> 00:11:05.728
and my younger son,
completely out of the blue,

00:11:05.752 --> 00:11:10.656
said, "Mom, we don't know anybody
who voted for Trump, right?"

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:13.649
(Laughter)

00:11:13.673 --> 00:11:17.609
And I paused and I took a deep breath.

00:11:18.243 --> 00:11:19.425
"Yes, we do."

00:11:19.449 --> 00:11:20.449
(Laughter)

00:11:20.473 --> 00:11:21.623
"The Quattromanis."

00:11:21.944 --> 00:11:24.013
And his response was so great.

00:11:24.037 --> 00:11:27.227
He kind of got this confused
look on his face, and he said ...

00:11:27.719 --> 00:11:28.870
"But we love them."

00:11:28.894 --> 00:11:31.862
(Laughter)